+    PARTITION p1 VALUES LESS THAN (11) (
+      subpartition q3 values less than (15), ---------------
+                                                           ---Subpartition
+      subpartition q4 values less than (20)	 ---------------
+    )
+  As the above example showing, One Partition has num_parts Subpartitions.
+  Subpartition helps to manager sub-partitions information for one main
+  partition.
